Embedded to provide an offline RFB client without a CDN or a Node build step.
noVNC core: MPL-2.0; vendored pako: MIT; see LICENSE.txt and source headers.
The matching source ships in this repository and can be fetched at runtime
under /vendor/ on an authenticated desktop URL.
